\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{e}^{4\\theta }\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{e}^{4\\theta }\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{8}({e}^{4\\pi }-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{8}({e}^{4\\pi }-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
